// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218.011
// Description: Rundll32 can be use by Cobalt Strike with StartW function to load DLLs from the command line.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((src.process.cmdline containsCIS ".dll" AND (src.process.cmdline endswithCIS " StartW" OR src.process.cmdline endswithCIS ",StartW")) AND ((src.process.image.path endswithCIS "\\rundll32.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "RUNDLL32.EXE") OR ((src.process.cmdline containsCIS "rundll32.exe" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "rundll32 "))))
